# ✈️ Airline Operations & Delay Analytics Dashboard

A premium storytelling-based **Power BI dashboard project** built using the **2015 U.S. Flight Delays & Cancellations Dataset**.
This project focuses on airline operational intelligence, delay analytics, airport congestion monitoring, and carrier performance benchmarking using modern data analytics and visualization techniques.

---

# 📌 Project Overview

The dashboard analyzes millions of airline flight records to uncover:

* Operational efficiency
* Delay patterns
* Cancellation trends
* Airport congestion
* Airline performance
* Traffic distribution
* Root-cause delay analysis
* Strategic operational insights

The project is designed with a **cinematic aviation command center theme** using a dark modern UI and storytelling-driven analytics.

---

# 🎯 Business Objective

To help airline stakeholders:

* Monitor nationwide flight operations
* Identify operational bottlenecks
* Analyze delay and cancellation causes
* Compare airline performance
* Improve operational efficiency
* Support strategic decision-making

---

# 🛠️ Tools & Technologies Used

| Tool / Technology | Purpose                               |
| ----------------- | ------------------------------------- |
| Power BI          | Dashboard development & visualization |
| Python            | Data cleaning & preprocessing         |
| Pandas            | Data transformation                   |
| NumPy             | Data handling                         |
| Google Colab      | Data cleaning & preprocessing         |
| VS Code           | Project development environment       |   |
| DAX               | KPI creation & calculations           |
| Power Query       | Data transformation in Power BI       |

---

# 📂 Dataset Information

## Dataset Used

### 2015 Flight Delays & Cancellations Dataset

Dataset contains:

* 5.8+ million flight records
* Airline details
* Airport information
* Arrival & departure delays
* Cancellation reasons
* Flight routes
* Distance metrics
* Operational timings

---

# 🧹 Data Cleaning & Preprocessing

Data cleaning was performed using **Python** in **Google Colab** before importing into Power BI.

## Cleaning Tasks Performed

* Removed unnecessary columns
* Handled missing values
* Converted date columns
* Optimized data types
* Created delay status categories
* Generated time block segmentation
* Exported optimized `.parquet` files
* Validated KPI metrics using Python

---

# 📊 Dashboard Pages

---

# 🏠 Page 1 — Airline Operations Command Center

### Purpose

Executive introduction page with cinematic storytelling visuals.

### Key Features

* Hero operational trend chart
* Executive KPI overview
* Flight punctuality overview
* Operational insight panel
* Dark aviation command-center theme

### Business Focus

Provides a high-level snapshot of nationwide airline operations and network stability.

---

# 📈 Page 2 — Operational Performance Overview

### Purpose

Analyze traffic activity and operational pressure patterns.

### Key Features

* Monthly operational traffic trends
* Weekly flight distribution
* Time-window flight activity
* Airport traffic analysis
* Delay movement patterns

### Business Focus

Identifies peak operational periods and traffic congestion behavior.

---

# ⚠️ Page 3 — Delay & Cancellation Intelligence

### Purpose

Root-cause investigation of delays and operational disruptions.

### Key Features

* Delay reason treemap
* Cancellation funnel chart
* Delay heatmap
* Airport congestion scatter plot
* Delay accumulation waterfall chart

### Business Focus

Analyzes operational instability and identifies major contributors to airline disruptions.

---

# 🛫 Page 4 — Airline Performance Intelligence

### Purpose

Benchmark airline carriers based on operational efficiency.

### Key Features

* Airline efficiency comparison
* Carrier ranking analysis
* Cancellation performance analysis
* Delay distribution comparison
* Performance scorecards

### Business Focus

Evaluates airline operational reliability and comparative performance.

---

# 🌍 Page 5 — Airport Congestion & Route Analytics

### Purpose

Analyze airport pressure, route activity, and network congestion.

### Key Features

* Busy airport analysis
* Route performance intelligence
* Airport congestion monitoring
* High-delay route detection
* Traffic density analytics

### Business Focus

Identifies operational hotspots and airport network bottlenecks.

